                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff79a64a-7d05-30d5-bd34-976ff6867008",
                                        "entry_id": "6d99405d-f210-3787-bff1-9ab03ba55316",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A truck-like enclosed vehicle on tracks, designed to move on snow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snowcat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b845eab5-4bf9-33a0-a024-b77770dea3c7",
                                        "entry_id": "a604634a-2eeb-386a-bc00-d5e0dda67b37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A visual representation of a cat made from snow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b17af02-276f-41ce-ac74-bdd1a2c91bef",
                                                "sense_id": "b845eab5-4bf9-33a0-a024-b77770dea3c7",
                                                "text": "Katy rolled snowballs and tried to make a snowcat instead of a snowman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df242caa-dc45-4086-96ec-f7848cf3b135",
                                                "sense_id": "b845eab5-4bf9-33a0-a024-b77770dea3c7",
                                                "text": "Kathryn Naylor’s beautiful illustrations add a magic element that makes even an earless snowcat believable for young readers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c31dc96-d79f-4a6c-8345-2daaaf4bbc8c",
                                                "sense_id": "b845eab5-4bf9-33a0-a024-b77770dea3c7",
                                                "text": "“I know. Instead of making a snowman or a snowlady, let’s make a snowcat,” I said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5330bfac-69bc-43b7-a0b2-b79892e76936",
                                                "sense_id": "b845eab5-4bf9-33a0-a024-b77770dea3c7",
                                                "text": "One student responds “Snowman.” The teacher says “Yes.” Looking down at the picture, she orally says “Oh” and signs “Excuse me.” She points to the picture of the snowman’s ears and whiskers and signs: “Snowcat, I am mistaken. Look at the cat’s ears and whiskers.” She shows the picture around and signs “It’s a snowcat!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "613b86b0-1905-44be-8e0b-08395c234fbf",
                                                "sense_id": "b845eab5-4bf9-33a0-a024-b77770dea3c7",
                                                "text": "‘A snowcat? Like a thing you ride on, on mountains and stuff?’ Elmo asked, sounding excited. ‘Is it, like, a kit?’ / ‘No, sorry, El. It was an actual cat, made of snow. Sean’s cat. Snowman style. I hope it’s still there in the morning. I don’t know how high up the beach the tide will go.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c8a52fce-d01b-495e-94c3-8b8a8a6c6a78",
                        "source_entry_id": "c2be720f-b3bc-393e-aaa9-6704ddf05386",
                        "source_sense_id": "15a42b17-cdce-3d34-a758-3e6f33e4b67d",
                        "target_lang_word": "snowmobile",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "snowmobile",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a1ce6fd-ac00-3d5b-90e7-05b3bfa6f3e1",
                                        "entry_id": "96812052-39b4-3006-bfb5-b69088583a83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vehicle with skis at the front and a caterpillar track at the rear, used for travelling over snow, sometimes as sport."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80e02f3a-f030-4765-9460-1611770a28c3",
                                                "sense_id": "7a1ce6fd-ac00-3d5b-90e7-05b3bfa6f3e1",
                                                "text": "From the manufacture of snowgoing equipment such as snow cats, it diversified first into that of snowmobiles (and later skidoos, or water scooters), then into railcar and locomotive manufacture, and finally into the manufacture of small (less than 100-seat) commercial aircraft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "981cf1d4-c078-4da5-a181-6e92f6641fe5",
                                                "sense_id": "7a1ce6fd-ac00-3d5b-90e7-05b3bfa6f3e1",
                                                "text": "Lance Allan: \"When you first saw that video of you in a snowmobile suit at five years old on national TV and on our air. Were you a little bit like, c'mon Mom and Dad, are you going to do me like that?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
